# Clean Architecture Boundaries
- **Core:** `domain-entities`, `value-objects`, `domain-services`
- **App:** `use-cases`, `DTOs`, `mappers`
- **Infra:** `db-repos`, `ext-apis`, `queues`, `file-storage`
- **UI:** `pages`, `components`, `hooks`, `stores`

# Import Direction Law
- **Strict Inward-Only Imports:** `Core` ← `App` ← `Infra` ← `UI`
- Outer layers may import inner layers; inner layers MUST NEVER import outer layers.
- Modules must be structured as feature-based / vertical slices.